      ],
      "en": "“Though I speak, my grief is not subsided. Though I forbear, what am I eased?",
      "ko": "내가 말하여도 내 근심이 풀리지 아니하나니 잠잠한들 어찌 평안하랴",
      "source_text_hash": "832be87abe220a40f857d9dcd74fb7f815222a8436d2311f18c42f7dce318617",
      "translation_text_hash": "59d1b6a576efbc2ad8022b89042803b836a04a6b259b066a30e1f5ac4861bac3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "내가 말하여도 내 근심이 풀리지 아니하나니 잠잠한들 어찌 평안하랴"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "59d1b6a576efbc2ad8022b89042803b836a04a6b259b066a30e1f5ac4861bac3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JOB:16:7",
      "sequence": 13246,
      "chapter_label": "JOB 16",
      "verse_label": "7",
