      ],
      "en": "They have gaped on me with their mouth. They have struck me on the cheek reproachfully. They gather themselves together against me.",
      "ko": "무리들은 나를 향하여 입을 벌리며 나를 천대하여 뺨을 치며 함께 모여 나를 대적하는구나",
      "source_text_hash": "8549c61c5db755b81cd832f666f661c55aaff17f068c093ea3147cee777bb5c0",
      "translation_text_hash": "f9df1739cbe3526aab51908d214ef5cc090c54b19195ce5ea294a4763315a353",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "무리들은 나를 향하여 입을 벌리며 나를 천대하여 뺨을 치며 함께 모여 나를 대적하는구나"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "f9df1739cbe3526aab51908d214ef5cc090c54b19195ce5ea294a4763315a353"
      ]
