      "en": "God delivers me to the ungodly, and casts me into the hands of the wicked.",
      "ko": "하나님이 나를 경건치 않은 자에게 붙이시며 악인의 손에 던지셨구나",
      "source_text_hash": "52aa43ee4993f6b225336eaa3baba35dd20557e2ea4b4911b0b4b74fd1f12941",
      "translation_text_hash": "af5c5c92f5a0aa3d23bdc727016810e44dc0f1f7828bc13713aa558bac8f2919",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "하나님이 나를 경건치 않은 자에게 붙이시며 악인의 손에 던지셨구나"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "af5c5c92f5a0aa3d23bdc727016810e44dc0f1f7828bc13713aa558bac8f2919"
      ]
    },
    {
